        {"platform": "PU9010-3000 kg", "max_1": 3000, "e_1": 1, "max_2": null, "e_2": null, "load_cell_emax": 2000}
      ],
      "description": "Two-range variants (-1000 kg and -2000 kg) have Max1/e1 and Max2/e2; single-range variants (-3000 kg) have Max = 3000 kg with e1 = 1 kg. load_cell_emax is the required maximum capacity of the four load cells.",
